bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat --token df0c17ef351e73ed92637fd17a16fa3348163542c1084c150f4c3a515802f4d5
```
### Automated Testing
```bash
# Run diagnostic test
node openclaw-standalone/test-chat-debug.mjs
# Run test script
bash openclaw-standalone/test-chat.sh
```
## Conclusion
The chat command is **functionally complete** and the AI agent is **working correctly**. The issue is specifically with gateway authentication in local mode. The agent successfully falls back to embedded mode, which provides full functionality.
